.SS "int32_t schultz_draw_fill_polygon (\fBschultz_draw_list\fP * list, const \fBschultz_point\fP * points, uint32_t count, \fBschultz_paint\fP paint, uint32_t rule)"

.PP
Appends a filled polygon\&. The points are copied into the arena, so the caller's array may be a stack local and need not outlive the call\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIlist\fP The list to append to\&. Must not be NULL\&. 
.br
\fIpoints\fP The vertices, in order\&. Must not be NULL\&. The polygon is implicitly closed from the last point back to the first\&. 
.br
\fIcount\fP Number of vertices\&. Must be greater than zero\&. 
.br
